# Review graphs. Reviews of a project inside this folder are written next to the shipped demo graphs; only the
# demos (npm run demo / npm run live) are kept in git. Anything else there is a local review.
ui/public/graphs/*
!ui/public/graphs/index.json
!ui/public/graphs/demo-*
!ui/public/graphs/live-*
!ui/public/graphs/snapshot-main.json
!ui/public/graphs/snapshot-main.brief.md

